" value="Bins by predicted probability (bins with &amp;ge; 50 snapshots). Between 0.01 and 0.3 the BBN over-predicts by about a factor of two; the random forest puts 22,476 snapshots near 0.04 that fail at 0.0006, a seventy-fold gap." style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#52606d;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;rotation=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640.00" y="240.00" width="320.00" height="140.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>